 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nLuxury Savannah to Shore 9 Day Adventure\nENQUIRE NOW\n\n$5699pp\n\n*price based on 6 people sharing\n\nBEST TIME TO TRAVEL\n\nJun- Sept\n\nDURATION\n\n9 Days\n\nLOCATIONS\n\nArusha, Tarangire, Serengeti,\nNgorongoro Crater, Zanzibar\n\nSTARTING POINT\n\nFlight into Kilimanjaro\n\nEmbark on an unforgettable nine-day journey from the expansive savannahs of Tanzania to the pristine shores of Zanzibar. This 'Savannah to Shore Safari' offers a comprehensive exploration of some of Tanzania's most iconic landscapes, including the wildlife-rich Tarangire, the vast Serengeti plains, and the majestic Ngorongoro Crater. Experience the thrill of game drives in search of the Big Five and witness breathtaking natural wonders along the way. After your adventurous safari, unwind on the idyllic beaches of Zanzibar, where white sands and turquoise waters provide a serene finale to your all-encompassing safari and beach escape. This trip promises the perfect blend of adventure and relaxation, making it an ideal choice for those looking to immerse themselves in Africa’s raw beauty and tranquil beach life.\n\nITINERARY\n\nDay 1\nDay 2\nDay 3\nDay 4\nDay 5\nDay 6\nDay 7-8\nDay 9\n​\n\nDay 1: Upon arrival after your long flight, you will be warmly greeted at the airport by our friendly representative alongside an experienced driver-guide. They will introduce you to the stunning landscapes and vibrant culture of Tanzania as they escort you to your accommodation in Arusha. Here, you can unwind and prepare for the exciting adventures ahead. If the weather is clear, your welcome will be made even more spectacular with breathtaking views of Mount Meru and the elusive Mount Kilimanjaro, often referred to as the \"shy girl\" due to its often cloud-covered peak. This serene start sets the tone for your thrilling nine-day journey from savannah to shore.\n\nMeal Plan\n\nBed & Breakfast\n\nAccomodation\n\nLake Duluti Lodge\n\nDestination\n\nArusha is known as the safari capital of Tanzania's Northern Safari Circuit.\n\nPackage Price includes:\n\n• English speaking professional guide;\n\n• Meals and accommodation as specified in the itinerary \n\n• Private transportation by FWD vehicle equipped with open roof \n\n• Airport Transfers \n\n• Park Entry Fees, VAT inclusive\n\n• Ngorongoro Crater Fee, VAT inclusive\n\n• Unlimited (pure) drinking water throughout the safari;\n\n• Accommodation in Zanzibar \n\n• Local flight from Serena Airstrip – Zanzibar \n\n• Zanzibar airport transfers \n\n• Flying doctor \n\nPackage Price Does not include:\n\n• Airfares and related costs such as personal travel insurance, visas, and vaccinations;\n\n• Cost of any client-requested itinerary modifications while the safari is in progress;\n\n• Any expenses of a personal nature such as extra beverages, laundry, etc.;\n\n• Gratuity for your safari guides\n\n• Activities in Zanzibar\n\nPrices can vary between seasons\n\n$5699pp  6+ people\n\n$5849pp  4 people\n\n$6399pp  2 people \n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
